<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>higher. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    61.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    60.50-61.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 1.00 higher. Top 51.00</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-450 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
</text>
